$INCLUDE general.header

$PROBLEM Vancomycin for gram-positive infected patients (or not). A priori percentiles.

$INPUT ID TIME EVID AMT CMT SS II DV age bodyweight CLcr gram_positive RATE

$INCLUDE general.dataimport

$INCLUDE ch.tucuxi.vancomycin.yamamoto2009.pkmodel


$ERROR

Y = F * (1 + THETA(5) * ETA(5))
if (Y.LT.0) Y = 0
IPRED=Y



$OMEGA STANDARD CORRELATION BLOCK(4) FIX
0.375
0 0.182
0 0 0.192
0 0 0 0.728

$OMEGA 1 FIX; EPS1 ; Replacement of SIGMA

; Sigma is replaced by an additional Omega
$SIGMA 0.0 STANDARD FIX

$INCLUDE general.apriori.perc.footer
